or their results for operational services or real-world decisions is not.
Merely describing an activity as "research" or publishing a paper does not make
an otherwise prohibited use permissible.

3. Prohibited uses

You may not use the Materials, or modified versions incorporating the Materials,
for any purpose outside Section 2. In particular, you may not:

(a) sell, commercially license, or otherwise commercially exploit the Materials;
(b) incorporate them into commercial products, paid services, commercial research
    and development, or enterprise business operations;
(c) deploy them in production systems or use them for operational activities;
(d) provide external detection, verification, forensic analysis, or other
    operational services using them; or
(e) use them or their results to make, inform, or support real-world decisions,
    including content moderation, operational fact-checking, authentication
    services, legal proceedings, or law enforcement.

The restrictions on production deployment, operational use, service provision,
and real-world decision-making apply whether or not a fee is charged and
whether the user is an individual, company, university, government body, or
nonprofit organization. Human review does not remove these restrictions.

